  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "……<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳就是偵探嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "2026202600100003110000FF01014F6059B35C31662F507563A255CEFF1F00100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是的",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F76840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我是代理",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211662F4EE374060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "算了，如果是瑪琪艾兒拜託的人，\n應該沒問題吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7B974E86FF0C5982679C662F746A742A827E515262DC8A1776844EBAFF0C000A61C98A726C92554F984C5427300200100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那麼我們就直接切入正題吧！\n在這個密阿雷出現了一個不得了的傢伙。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A39EBC621150115C3176F463A5520751656B63984C5427FF01000A57289019500B5BC6963F96F751FA73FE4E864E00500B4E0D5F974E86768450A24F19300200100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那就是……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A35C31662F2026202600100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "超～～～巨大的～<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8D85FF5EFF5EFF5E5DE859277684FF5E00100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "掘掘兔！！！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "639863985154FF01FF01FF0100100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "牠比我的掘掘兔大了兩倍以上，\n不只大小超乎尋常，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n兩眼還閃閃發光！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 508,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "72606BD46211768463986398515459274E865169500D4EE54E0AFF0C000A4E0D53EA59275C0F8D854E4E5C0B5E38FF0C00100001BE00000A5169773C908495839583767C5149FF0100100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "和牠對到眼的瞬間，\n我就靠著本能逃走了……！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n雖然我遊歷各地經歷過許多事，\n但這樣的恐懼還是第一次。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "548C72605C0D5230773C768477AC9593FF0C000A62115C3197608457672C80FD90038D704E8620262026FF0100100001BE01000A96D671366211904A6B77540457307D936B77904E8A31591A4E8BFF0C000A4F4690196A237684605061FC9084662F7B2C4E006B21300200100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "更可怕的是我看到牠的地點。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n那是一個極為普通的巷子……\n是在野生特區的外面啊！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "66F453EF60157684662F6211770B52307260768457309EDE300200100001BE01000A90A3662F4E00500B697570BA666E901A76845DF75B5020262026000A662F572891CE751F72795340768459169762554AFF0100100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我們不能就這樣放任那傢伙不管。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳快把我的任務<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>登錄到導航<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>，\n過來目的地一趟吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 12,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621150114E0D80FD5C3190196A23653E4EFB90A350A24F194E0D7BA1300200100001BE01000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B35FEB628A621176844EFB52D900100002FF000006767B930452305C0E822A00100002FF000000FF0C000A904E4F8676EE768457304E008D9F5427FF0100100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "嘿嘿！\n膝蓋忍不住地發抖……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n就是這附近。\n曾出現超巨大掘掘兔的地方。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 940,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "563F563FFF01000A819D84CB5FCD4E0D4F4F5730767C62962026202600100001BE01000A5C31662F901996448FD13002000A66FE51FA73FE8D855DE859276398639851547684573065B9300200100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "掘哇！？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1028,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "639854C7FF01FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "怎麼了，搭檔！\n難道是……那傢伙嗎！？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1040,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "600E9EBC4E86FF0C642D6A94FF01000A96E39053662F2026202690A350A24F1955CEFF01FF1F00100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "掘嚕嚕！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1088,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "639856955695FF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好巨大！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597D5DE85927FF0100100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好可怕！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1120,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597D53EF6015FF0100100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好厲害！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597D53B25BB3FF0100100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "就是這傢伙！絕對沒錯！！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
