      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C31662F901950A24F19FF017D555C0D6C92932FFF01FF0100100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "掘嚕嚕～啊！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "639856955695FF5E554AFF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "太厲害了！居然能戰勝\n那麼巨大的掘掘兔。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1224,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "592A53B25BB34E86FF015C45713680FD623052DD000A90A39EBC5DE859277684639863985154300200100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "話說回來，看到剛剛的對戰\n讓我想起了一件事。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8A718AAA56DE4F86FF0C770B5230525B525B76845C0D6230000A8B93621160F38D774E864E004EF64E8B300200100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "聽說在很久以前，在某個地區\n人們畏懼著身形巨大而且眼睛發光的<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n狂暴寶可夢，並稱牠們為<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>頭目<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "807D8AAA57285F884E454EE5524DFF0C572867D0500B57305340000A4EBA5011754F61FC84578EAB5F625DE85927800C4E14773C775B767C5149768400100001BE00000A72C266B45BF653EF5922FF0C4E267A317260501170BA00100002FF000006982D76EE00100002FF000000300200100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "為什麼現代的密阿雷市\n會出現類似的寶可夢呢？<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n我實在是想不通……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "70BA4EC09EBC73FE4EE376845BC6963F96F75E02000A670351FA73FE985E4F3C76845BF653EF59225462FF1F00100001BE01000A62115BE65728662F60F34E0D901A2026202600100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我說搭檔啊，\n不覺得有種不好的預感嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62118AAA642D6A94554AFF0C000A4E0D89BA5F9767097A2E4E0D597D76849810611F55CEFF1F00100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "掘哇嚕……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "639854C75695202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "總之<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳幫了大忙了。\n不愧是受瑪琪艾兒之託的人。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n有像<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳這樣的人在，\n即使城市裡出現了頭目也不用擔心呢！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1596,
